    == Mapeamento de Tipos (Arquitetura)
    * **Banco de Dados (DB)** ->> **PHP (64-bit)**
    * BIGINT (8 bytes, PK/FK) ->> int (8-byte integer)
    * INT (4 bytes) ->> int
    * TINYINT(1) ->> bool
    * VARCHAR / TEXT ->> string
    * DECIMAL ->> string
    * DATETIME / DATE ->> DateTimeInterface
    endlegend
